Lay a trap that releases a burst of antimagic energies (radius 2), draining up to [181, 212, 236, 257, 275 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; WIL 100)] mana, [90, 106, 118, 128, 137 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; WIL 100)] vim, [45, 53, 59, 64, 68 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; WIL 100)] positive and [45, 53, 59, 64, 68 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; WIL 100)] negative energies from affected targets, while inflicting up to [181, 213, 237, 257, 275 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; WIL 100)] arcane damage based on the resources drained, silencing for [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5)] turns, and removing up to [1, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5)] beneficial magical effects or sustains.

The draining effect scales with your Willpower, and you must have 25 Willpower to prepare this trap.

This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.
